---
---

<section id="about" class="section-padding bg-qhapaq-dark-950 relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-1/2 h-full bg-gradient-to-l from-qhapaq-terracota-900/10 to-transparent"></div>
  
  <div class="container-custom relative z-10">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
      <div class="reveal-on-scroll">
        <div class="inline-block px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-qhapaq-terracota-500/10 border border-qhapaq-terracota-500/20 mb-6">
          <span class="text-qhapaq-terracota-400 font-semibold text-sm">¿Qué es Qhapaq?</span>
        </div>
        
        <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-display font-bold mb-6">
          Tu compañero inteligente de
          <span class="gradient-text"> exploración</span>
        </h2>
        
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-300 mb-6 text-balance">
          Qhapaq es la plataforma que combina inteligencia geográfica, datos en tiempo real y la sabiduría de una comunidad de exploradores para transformar cada viaje en una aventura segura.
        </p>
        
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-400 mb-8">
          Desde rutas por carretera hasta senderos remotos en los Andes, Qhapaq te proporciona información crítica sobre clima, altitud, peligros y puntos de interés, incluso sin conexión.
        </p>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="flex items-start space-x-4">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-qhapaq-terracota-500/10 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-qhapaq-terracota-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-lg mb-1">Análisis Inteligente</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-400">Algoritmos avanzados evalúan cada ruta en tiempo real</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start space-x-4">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-qhapaq-terracota-500/10 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-qhapaq-terracota-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-lg mb-1">Comunidad Activa</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-400">Comparte experiencias y descubre rutas verificadas</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start space-x-4">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-qhapaq-terracota-500/10 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-qhapaq-terracota-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3.055 11H5a2 2 0 012 2v1a2 2 0 002 2 2 2 0 012 2v2.945M8 3.935V5.5A2.5 2.5 0 0010.5 8h.5a2 2 0 012 2 2 2 0 104 0 2 2 0 012-2h1.064M15 20.488V18a2 2 0 012-2h3.064M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-lg mb-1">Funciona Offline</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-400">Descarga mapas y navega sin conexión a internet</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal-on-scroll relative">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4">
          <div class="relative h-64 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden">
            <img 
              src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1526392060635-9d6019884377?w=800&q=80" 
              alt="Carretera andina"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover"
              loading="lazy"
            />
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80 to-transparent"></div>
            <div class="absolute bottom-4 left-4 right-4">
              <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 mb-2">
                <div class="w-3 h-3 bg-qhapaq-terracota-400 rounded-full animate-pulse"></div>
                <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">Ruta activa</span>
              </div>
              <h4 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-white">Cusco → Machu Picchu</h4>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
            <div class="relative h-40 rounded-xl overflow-hidden">
              <img 
                src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1501594907352-04cda38ebc29?w=600&q=80" 
                alt="Montañas"
                class="w-full h-full object-cover"
                loading="lazy"
              />
              <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/40 flex items-center justify-center">
                <div class="text-center text-white">
                  <div class="text-3xl font-display font-bold">3,400m</div>
                  <div class="text-sm">Altitud</div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="relative h-40 rounded-xl overflow-hidden">
              <img 
                src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534447677768-be436bb09401?w=600&q=80" 
                alt="Clima"
                class="w-full h-full object-cover"
                loading="lazy"
              />
              <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/40 flex items-center justify-center">
                <div class="text-center text-white">
                  <div class="text-3xl font-display font-bold">18°C</div>
                  <div class="text-sm">Clima Óptimo</div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal-on-scroll" style="animation-delay: 0.2s;">
        <div class="relative">
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-qhapaq-terracota-500/20 to-qhapaq-terracota-700/20 rounded-3xl blur-3xl"></div>
          <div class="relative glass-effect rounded-3xl p-8 border-2 border-qhapaq-terracota-500/20">
            <div class="space-y-6">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-white/5 rounded-xl">
                <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
                  <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-qhapaq-terracota-500 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center">
                    <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                      <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z" />
                      <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z" />
                    </svg>
                  </div>
                  <div>
                    <div class="font-semibold">Ruta Activa</div>
                    <div class="text-sm text-gray-400">Camino Inca - Cusco</div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="text-qhapaq-terracota-400 font-semibold">4.2 km</div>
              </div>

              <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                <div class="p-4 bg-white/5 rounded-xl">
                  <div class="text-sm text-gray-400 mb-1">Altitud</div>
                  <div class="text-2xl font-display font-bold">3,400m</div>
                </div>
                <div class="p-4 bg-white/5 rounded-xl">
                  <div class="text-sm text-gray-400 mb-1">Clima</div>
                  <div class="text-2xl font-display font-bold">18°C</div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="p-4 bg-qhapaq-terracota-500/10 border border-qhapaq-terracota-500/20 rounded-xl">
                <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 mb-2">
                  <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-qhapaq-terracota-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
                  </svg>
                  <span class="font-semibold text-qhapaq-terracota-400">Alerta de Seguridad</span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-300">Zona de neblina reportada. Velocidad recomendada: 40 km/h</p>
              </div>

              <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-white/5 rounded-xl">
                <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
                  <div class="flex -space-x-2">
                    <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-400 to-blue-600 border-2 border-qhapaq-dark-950"></div>
                    <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-green-400 to-green-600 border-2 border-qhapaq-dark-950"></div>
                    <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-400 to-purple-600 border-2 border-qhapaq-dark-950"></div>
                  </div>
                  <span class="text-sm text-gray-400">+127 exploradores</span>
                </div>
                <span class="text-xs text-qhapaq-terracota-400">Activos hoy</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
